#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Orbit Note development-only content
/.local/
/work/
/outputs/
/release-assets/
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
/workspaces/
/private-workspaces/
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
# Private Google developer downloads/configuration (public examples stay tracked).
/config/*.local.json
/config/client_secret*.json
/android/app/google-services.json
# Keep pubspec.lock, .metadata and platform source. Test fixtures are not
# broadly ignored by extension: JSON, Markdown and database fixtures can be tracked.
